gure S7: extract the outer-London traffic-site NO2 point estimate, concentration units, percentage effect, confidence interval, exact averaging dates and station membership. Check whether the ULEZ3 baseline incorporates anticipatory changes; a three-month nonsignificant result cannot settle the full-year claims."]}, "state_hash": "0867a048baa0dd94fe8a898c22f4d96660d1768cb6354094b4ee462887b1a238", "prev_hash": "fe978eeba3e5a93f1c14f5a5b1a50e934ba09258dafbb2e939c38307366b1333", "usage": [{"provider": "openai", "model": "gpt-6-astra", "input_tokens": 46699, "output_tokens": 2726, "role": "critic"}], "hash": "018a8dc91cc4d40ae5b48cbcab88d61153307d5119b96f611e98d1b551d60439"}
